      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.whitetopva.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Whitetop marks the southern terminus of the 34‑mile Virginia Creeper Trail, a popular path for biking, hiking, and horseback riding.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
